WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:03.390
Maho!

00:05.590 --> 00:07.010
Oh~!

00:07.010 --> 00:08.980
Please let me in.

00:09.470 --> 00:11.910
Please teach me more about how you practise.

00:11.910 --> 00:12.900
Okay...

00:13.300 --> 00:15.310
If you're okay with us teaching you...

00:16.030 --> 00:17.210
That's right.

00:17.210 --> 00:21.930
We came here to practise, so that's more important.

00:21.930 --> 00:23.260
But...

00:23.260 --> 00:25.420
It's probably better to leave her alone for a while.

00:25.840 --> 00:27.740
Let her calm down a bit.

00:27.740 --> 00:28.830
Oh~!

00:28.830 --> 00:30.850
Knowing Maho, she'll be just fine.

00:34.170 --> 00:36.090
Please let us in, too.

00:36.090 --> 00:38.580
We're sorry for making such a big fuss.

00:38.580 --> 00:39.810
Everyone...

00:39.810 --> 00:41.170
That's right.

00:41.170 --> 00:43.880
You're a weak team that has no foundation or experience.

00:43.880 --> 00:47.100
You should be grateful that we're even letting you practise with us.

00:50.330 --> 00:52.270
We're running short of time.

00:52.270 --> 00:53.320
Let's start practice.

00:54.600 --> 00:55.530
I'm sorry.

01:14.970 --> 01:18.300
Don't give up and do your best

01:18.300 --> 01:21.680
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:21.680 --> 01:24.730
I know perfectly

01:24.730 --> 01:28.400
How weak a person is on their own

01:28.600 --> 01:31.570
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:31.570 --> 01:35.240
I hold them close to my chest

01:35.240 --> 01:38.200
Your gentle words

01:38.200 --> 01:42.160
Caress my cheeks

01:42.160 --> 01:45.200
The irritation that has been building up

01:45.200 --> 01:48.000
From wanting to reach the goal

01:48.000 --> 01:52.170
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:52.170 --> 01:55.760
The place that warms it up

01:55.760 --> 01:58.680
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:58.680 --> 02:02.180
We have to protect this

02:02.180 --> 02:03.640
We're unripe fighters!

02:03.640 --> 02:05.560
We won't lose now

02:05.560 --> 02:08.940
We will raise our small hands up in the air

02:08.940 --> 02:12.360
Take in that vital power, embrace it

02:12.360 --> 02:15.820
Then release it towards the sky!

02:15.820 --> 02:17.360
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:17.360 --> 02:19.200
jump and shoot

02:17.360 --> 02:19.200
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:19.200 --> 02:22.120
I will pass the ball to you

02:22.120 --> 02:26.410
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:26.410 --> 02:29.960
Game

02:26.410 --> 02:29.960
Will move the game along

02:36.550 --> 02:40.430
The Bridge for Five People

02:47.810 --> 02:48.560
Airi!

02:48.560 --> 02:49.310
Okay!

02:55.230 --> 02:57.030
They're surprisingly quick.

02:57.030 --> 02:57.610
Yeah.

02:57.610 --> 02:59.570
They might be at a pretty high level.

02:59.570 --> 03:00.820
What are you talking about?

03:01.220 --> 03:03.720
There's no way those amateurs are that good.

03:04.890 --> 03:06.620
Thank you very much!

03:09.820 --> 03:11.210
Hasegawa-kun.

03:11.210 --> 03:13.500
Look there.

03:14.210 --> 03:15.250
Saki.

03:15.670 --> 03:17.080
At times like these,

03:17.080 --> 03:19.960
it's better for a teammate to go rather than the coach.

03:30.810 --> 03:32.870
Are you still angry?

03:37.860 --> 03:39.900
I'm really pathetic, aren't I?

03:39.900 --> 03:42.280
I should've told them, but I didn't.

03:42.780 --> 03:44.200
I'm a failure of a coach.

03:48.000 --> 03:50.610
It's still not too late.

03:54.170 --> 03:56.500
Didn't you enjoy playing basketball?

03:56.500 --> 03:57.250
Huh?!

03:57.680 --> 04:00.010
Isn't that what the five of us have been doing up until now?

04:00.010 --> 04:02.260
I'm asking you if you found it fun.

04:02.260 --> 04:04.300
Of course it was fun.

04:04.300 --> 04:07.100
Wasn't I the one that asked you to join?

04:07.100 --> 04:08.560
Don't act like it was your idea!

04:08.560 --> 04:12.280
Then why are you skipping practice and spacing out here so angrily?

04:13.120 --> 04:14.350
I'm not angry.

04:15.150 --> 04:17.360
I just wanted to take part in the tournament as the five of us.

04:17.360 --> 04:22.740
I wanted to taste the feeling of winning, just like how we won the tournament and beat the boys' basketball club.

04:23.740 --> 04:25.530
How conceited you are.

04:25.530 --> 04:29.440
Talking like you could've beaten
anyone you met in the tournament...

04:29.440 --> 04:31.500
Even though you're way worse than me.

04:31.500 --> 04:34.170
There's no way I'd lose to you, Saki!

04:35.790 --> 04:39.340
Maho-chan's basketball hasn't ended yet.

04:42.090 --> 04:44.760
Of course, having a goal is important.

04:44.760 --> 04:47.760
But for now, they can just play basketball for the sake of it, too.

04:48.260 --> 04:49.470
Now...

04:49.980 --> 04:53.850
To me, coaching is my basketball now.

04:57.620 --> 04:59.360
Senpai...

04:59.810 --> 05:02.560
If I really tried, I could walk.

05:02.560 --> 05:06.430
But it hurts when I jump even a little, and I can't bear the pain.

05:06.430 --> 05:09.660
Injuries sure are troublesome.

05:13.460 --> 05:15.040
I'm sorry for telling you all this.

05:15.040 --> 05:18.830
But even though I can't play basketball, I still love the sport.

05:19.380 --> 05:22.130
I want to face it honestly.

05:24.090 --> 05:25.510
That's right.

05:25.510 --> 05:28.640
When I took up coaching...

05:29.180 --> 05:32.060
I was making my basketball their basketball, too.

05:32.840 --> 05:34.600
Somewhere down the line,

05:34.600 --> 05:37.230
their development became my development, too.

05:38.560 --> 05:42.730
Maho-chan will face basketball in the same way you do, Hasegawa-kun.

05:43.280 --> 05:44.190
Yes.

05:45.200 --> 05:48.030
Ah, there you are, Subarun!

05:48.030 --> 05:48.950
Maho!

05:48.950 --> 05:50.320
Hey, watch me.

05:50.320 --> 05:52.370
I'm having a duel with Saki now.

05:58.330 --> 06:00.290
Give me your best shot.

06:00.290 --> 06:02.420
That's my line.

06:02.420 --> 06:05.210
I won't lose to someone like you, who can't do anything but shoot.

06:05.650 --> 06:10.730
Then, if you steal the ball or protect the ball for 20 seconds in a row, you'll score one point.

06:10.730 --> 06:12.640
First to three points wins.

06:12.640 --> 06:13.520
Is that okay?

06:18.690 --> 06:19.650
Here I go!

06:19.650 --> 06:20.860
Come at me any time!

06:26.360 --> 06:27.740
I'm not done yet!

06:33.630 --> 06:35.160
That's one point to me.

06:36.210 --> 06:37.960
Subaru-san, this is...

06:37.960 --> 06:38.670
Yeah.

06:38.670 --> 06:39.960
A duel, she said.

06:39.960 --> 06:41.130
Oh~!

06:41.130 --> 06:42.920
A duel sounds fun.

06:42.920 --> 06:45.210
Let me play, too!

06:45.210 --> 06:46.550
All right!

06:46.550 --> 06:50.040
Hina, we're both going to steal the ball from Saki this time.

06:50.040 --> 06:52.600
Two against one is unfair.

06:52.600 --> 06:54.810
Hey, you guys should join in, too.

06:55.610 --> 06:56.390
Is it okay?

06:56.390 --> 06:58.270
Of course!

06:58.270 --> 07:01.730
All right, let's split into teams!

07:10.240 --> 07:11.490
They're just...

07:11.490 --> 07:13.620
...having fun.

07:13.620 --> 07:16.870
Right now they're just having fun playing basketball!

07:35.970 --> 07:37.470
It looks like cotton candy.

07:37.470 --> 07:39.980
Can't you think of anything besides food?

07:39.980 --> 07:43.810
It looks like a sheep to me.

07:43.810 --> 07:45.650
A sheep, huh?

07:45.650 --> 07:47.110
That's cute.

07:48.530 --> 07:49.780
Everyone...

07:49.780 --> 07:50.490
I'm sorry.

07:51.990 --> 07:54.030
I'm sorry for skipping practice.

07:54.030 --> 07:57.410
I was only thinking about myself.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.160
I'm the one who should apologise.

08:00.870 --> 08:04.170
I'm sorry for keeping quiet about the
number of people we need for the tournament.

08:04.170 --> 08:05.460
And so...

08:06.590 --> 08:09.720
Subaru-san, in that case, I should apologise too.

08:09.720 --> 08:12.260
Even though I knew, I couldn't bring myself to say it.

08:12.260 --> 08:15.680
It's all fine, Subarun, Mo-kan!

08:16.240 --> 08:17.720
You were thinking about us,

08:17.720 --> 08:19.350
and that's why you stayed quiet about it.

08:19.850 --> 08:22.360
Even if we can't take part in the official match,

08:22.360 --> 08:24.950
our basketball won't change.

08:24.950 --> 08:26.120
Oh~!

08:26.120 --> 08:28.190
We'll be together from now on, too.

08:28.190 --> 08:31.280
We want to get better with the team we have now.

08:32.260 --> 08:33.700
Everyone...

08:34.400 --> 08:35.620
Thank you.

08:35.620 --> 08:39.500
I'll try my best to live up to everyone's expectations.

08:39.500 --> 08:42.120
As long as you continue to love and play basketball,

08:42.120 --> 08:43.580
let's enjoy it from the bottom of our hearts.

08:43.580 --> 08:44.920
Yes!

08:46.000 --> 08:47.090
All right!

08:47.090 --> 08:48.920
Then, let's practise again in the afternoon.

08:49.340 --> 08:51.670
Let's hurry and prepare for lunch.

08:51.670 --> 08:52.630
Yeah.

08:53.180 --> 08:54.840
Let's go!

08:56.140 --> 08:58.600
Seems like it went well.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.770
Yeah.

08:59.770 --> 09:02.850
But it's my turn now.

09:03.770 --> 09:09.770
As a coach, I have to do what I can to
protect those girls' basketball right now.

09:14.030 --> 09:17.030
so her first swimsuit was the one
assigned to her in elementary school.

09:16.440 --> 09:17.030
[First Swimsuit] She was always scared of water,

09:18.870 --> 09:20.280
Please!

09:22.710 --> 09:24.790
I will not allow you to play against our regulars.

09:24.790 --> 09:28.390
This is a critical time for preparing our players for the next match.

09:29.550 --> 09:33.090
We won't lose out in passion... or our skills, either!

09:33.800 --> 09:35.380
We will try our best.

09:35.380 --> 09:39.430
I'm sorry, but we don't even have a second to waste.

09:41.190 --> 09:43.970
Onee-chan, would you still refuse if I asked, too?

09:44.940 --> 09:46.890
You should understand.

09:47.330 --> 09:51.610
Winning, and furthering the team's achievements, is everything.

09:51.610 --> 09:54.070
Is that really enjoyable?

09:54.700 --> 09:55.990
Hey, Subaru!

09:56.450 --> 09:58.780
I think winning is important.

09:58.780 --> 10:01.840
But if all you want is to win matches,

10:01.840 --> 10:03.660
you don't have to play basketball; you could do anything.

10:04.080 --> 10:08.360
Isn't it our duty to teach how enjoyable basketball is?

10:10.820 --> 10:13.590
I want to have a match against the Keishin girls.

10:13.590 --> 10:15.090
It seems fun, too.

10:15.090 --> 10:18.470
Also, if this would affect our match,

10:18.470 --> 10:20.950
aren't you admitting that they're actually a strong team?

10:23.100 --> 10:24.600
Understood.

10:24.600 --> 10:27.640
It will be troublesome if we gained a bad reputation...

10:27.640 --> 10:30.060
...because it looked like we rejected the
match because we were afraid of losing.

10:30.060 --> 10:31.060
Then...

10:31.520 --> 10:32.860
I accept.

10:32.860 --> 10:34.790
Thank you very much!

10:39.030 --> 10:40.990
Eat up, everyone!

10:40.990 --> 10:43.330
Let's eat!

10:43.330 --> 10:45.160
Please eat a whole lot!

10:45.750 --> 10:47.080
It's delicious!

10:47.080 --> 10:50.000
It's so fluffy inside. It's delicious!

10:50.000 --> 10:51.090
It's true!

10:51.090 --> 10:52.080
It's to be expected.

10:52.640 --> 10:55.170
Manaka-senpai, thank you very much.

10:55.170 --> 10:57.630
No, I didn't do anything.

10:57.630 --> 11:00.880
In fact, I'm sorry for my sister's coldness.

11:01.290 --> 11:04.140
It's hard to believe that you two are siblings.

11:05.180 --> 11:08.560
Onee-chan became like that for me, so...

11:09.520 --> 11:16.820
She said that while I can't play, she would let me enjoy victories by having the team win matches.

11:17.990 --> 11:21.080
Although I appreciate it,

11:21.080 --> 11:23.530
there's no point if everyone's not having fun.

11:23.530 --> 11:26.160
Let's have a good time during the match tomorrow.

11:26.160 --> 11:28.410
Please take care of us, too.

11:28.410 --> 11:29.540
Oh~!

11:29.540 --> 11:30.790
We'll win for sure!

11:30.790 --> 11:33.880
We won't hold back, even for Manaka-chi!

11:33.880 --> 11:36.460
Subarun, let's have a special training session tomorrow!

11:36.460 --> 11:38.010
Okay.

11:38.010 --> 11:41.300
I'll do my best as your coach!

11:41.300 --> 11:42.010
Yes!

11:42.010 --> 11:46.930
I'll get better so Subarun will praise me during the special training tomorrow!

11:46.930 --> 11:48.390
Me too!

11:48.390 --> 11:50.180
I'll try my best, too!

11:54.190 --> 11:56.820
A girl's heart sure is complicated.

11:56.820 --> 11:57.980
That's no-

11:57.980 --> 12:02.360
You want him to try his best as a coach, yet you feel jealous.

12:02.360 --> 12:04.410
It's not what you're thinking!

12:04.410 --> 12:06.490
Just be honest with yourself.

12:06.490 --> 12:09.730
Didn't I say that I'd help you out?

12:12.500 --> 12:14.260
Hina, Hina, look!

12:14.260 --> 12:16.210
It's all bubbly!

12:16.210 --> 12:17.340
I got sunburned.

12:17.340 --> 12:18.800
It's true.

12:18.800 --> 12:20.590
It feels prickly.

12:21.920 --> 12:23.590
There!

12:23.590 --> 12:24.890
Take this!

12:26.010 --> 12:27.140
Me too!

12:27.140 --> 12:28.680
Oh~!

12:28.680 --> 12:30.350
It's hot!

12:30.350 --> 12:31.310
Take this!

12:33.890 --> 12:35.650
Looking at their practice formations,

12:35.650 --> 12:39.400
their defence seems to be thorough.

12:39.400 --> 12:42.240
Now, it's about how we penetrate that defence.

12:43.450 --> 12:48.530
Hasegawa-kun, about the baths:
they said you could use them for now.

12:48.530 --> 12:49.530
Are you going?

12:49.530 --> 12:51.200
Yes!

12:51.200 --> 12:53.370
Mist room

12:52.200 --> 12:53.370
Mist sauna?

12:53.770 --> 12:57.790
I was wondering if you'd like to do this to relax before your bath.

13:06.010 --> 13:08.600
But, what am I going to do...?

13:08.600 --> 13:11.810
Maybe I should just go ahead and try that out.

13:14.520 --> 13:17.910
Manaka-senpai, are you inside?

13:19.220 --> 13:20.110
Aoi?!

13:25.320 --> 13:27.200
Why are you here?!

13:33.200 --> 13:34.750
Why can't I open it?

13:34.750 --> 13:36.790
Didn't I say that I'd help you out?

13:37.580 --> 13:39.130
Don't tell me this is what she meant by "help"...

13:39.130 --> 13:40.840
Hey, what do you mean you can't open it...?

13:40.840 --> 13:42.460
The door is locked!

13:42.460 --> 13:44.380
Hey, don't look this way!

13:44.380 --> 13:45.800
I'm not looking!

13:45.800 --> 13:47.550
Don't come close to me!

13:55.910 --> 13:56.770
Aoi-chan?

13:58.940 --> 14:02.020
Geez, Senpai, you're such an idiot!

14:02.020 --> 14:04.470
Huh? It didn't go well?

14:04.470 --> 14:06.990
My sex appeal strategy failed?

14:06.990 --> 14:09.570
I can't get married any more.

14:18.000 --> 14:19.840
I wish that was all just a dream.

14:30.490 --> 14:31.430
Good morning.

14:34.390 --> 14:38.080
I think that was pretty bad,

14:38.080 --> 14:41.640
but it wasn't your fault, so let's both just forget about it.

14:41.640 --> 14:42.190
Okay?

14:42.190 --> 14:43.270
Got it.

14:43.270 --> 14:44.460
Thanks.

14:53.780 --> 14:55.740
As always, you go so fast.

14:55.740 --> 14:57.010
Of course.

14:57.010 --> 14:58.960
In fact, I'm amazed that you managed to keep up.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.130
Of course.

15:00.130 --> 15:01.710
I'm still continuing with my road work.

15:01.710 --> 15:03.540
I see.

15:07.130 --> 15:11.310
You really should join the Nashiba girls' basketball team.

15:11.310 --> 15:14.550
I can't be of help to you?

15:14.550 --> 15:15.720
That's not it.

15:15.720 --> 15:19.810
I'm grateful for all you've done.

15:19.810 --> 15:24.650
But I want you to play your own basketball,

15:24.650 --> 15:27.230
with your true feelings, Aoi.

15:27.230 --> 15:28.570
I already am.

15:29.690 --> 15:33.570
I just need my basketball to reach one person.

15:33.570 --> 15:36.660
I'll be satisfied as long as it reaches that person.

15:36.660 --> 15:40.910
It's my goal to beat him at some point in my life.

15:42.460 --> 15:46.380
Ever since we started playing basketball on that day...

15:52.930 --> 15:55.850
So, I'm already trying my best.

15:56.760 --> 16:00.430
I'm waiting for him to start playing basketball.

16:00.430 --> 16:01.560
Aoi...

16:03.480 --> 16:04.690
Well...

16:04.690 --> 16:05.810
I...

16:05.810 --> 16:07.270
I know.

16:07.270 --> 16:10.400
That person is occupied by his current basketball.

16:10.400 --> 16:13.990
That's why you should let me join in, too.

16:19.120 --> 16:20.830
Oh~!

16:20.830 --> 16:22.040
It went in!

16:22.040 --> 16:23.870
That's amazing, Hinata-chan!

16:23.870 --> 16:25.420
Let's try that one more time.

16:25.420 --> 16:26.330
Oh~!

16:26.330 --> 16:27.710
I'll try my best!

16:30.880 --> 16:32.590
Even if you're holding the ball, don't let down your guard.

16:32.590 --> 16:33.220
Yes!

16:44.730 --> 16:46.150
All right!

16:46.150 --> 16:47.440
We're doing great!

16:48.320 --> 16:51.570
Maho will beat the Chibi-Ribbon team for sure!

16:52.440 --> 16:53.240
Huh?

16:53.240 --> 16:54.240
A match?

16:54.550 --> 16:56.790
Apparently, Sensei decided on it for us.

16:56.790 --> 16:59.330
Even though they don't have any
experience in competitive basketball...

16:59.330 --> 17:02.950
Their footwork was pretty good when they were practising.

17:02.950 --> 17:03.830
Huh?!

17:03.830 --> 17:05.540
Those amateurs won't even last a second against us.

17:05.540 --> 17:06.390
Not one second.

17:06.390 --> 17:09.000
And then we'll crush them single-handedly.

17:12.050 --> 17:13.550
That was refreshing!

17:13.550 --> 17:15.470
Saki, do you have a moment?

17:17.720 --> 17:20.310
I think your footwork will be vital to the team.

17:20.310 --> 17:24.430
Can I really play a position like that?

17:24.430 --> 17:27.690
It's because it's you, Saki. That's why you can do it.

17:27.690 --> 17:30.520
I believe you're the most suitable one on the whole team.

17:31.860 --> 17:33.360
I understand.

17:33.360 --> 17:38.070
I'll try my best playing in the same position as Hasegawa-san!

17:38.070 --> 17:42.490
I think the most important thing is to prepare for attacks from the back.

17:42.490 --> 17:46.750
They will most likely move with their captain, Miu-san, as their focus.

17:46.750 --> 17:48.170
I see.

17:48.170 --> 17:51.920
Let's all think about how we should move on the court.

17:51.920 --> 17:56.420
They'll defend a lot more, so let's read the situation and change our movements...

17:58.640 --> 17:59.840
I'm bac-

18:07.060 --> 18:09.690
If Miho-nee saw Hinata-chan, she would be surprised.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.520
She got really good, after all.

18:13.650 --> 18:19.700
Airi, in the future, you might become a jewel in the world of girls' basketball.

18:20.660 --> 18:24.620
Maho, because you're here, everyone stays cheerful.

18:26.120 --> 18:31.540
Saki, thanks for always supporting everyone.

18:32.670 --> 18:35.080
Jump as high as you can tomorrow.

18:35.680 --> 18:39.070
As you always do with your jump shot.

18:43.760 --> 18:44.930
I'll try my best.

18:46.980 --> 18:48.890
Win it, Tomoka.

18:48.890 --> 18:51.060
We're counting on you, Ace.

19:02.870 --> 19:04.660
Let's finish this up quickly.

19:04.660 --> 19:06.790
That's our line!

19:20.050 --> 19:21.090
This is easy.

19:24.180 --> 19:28.100
To think that you challenged us with such half-hearted determination.

19:28.100 --> 19:30.020
It feels like you're just playing around.

19:30.020 --> 19:31.940
Damn it!

19:34.520 --> 19:35.190
Mo-kan!

19:35.190 --> 19:36.510
Here!

19:38.490 --> 19:40.360
Watch out, Chibi-Ribbon!

19:41.450 --> 19:43.160
Who's a Chibi-Ribbon?!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.120
You sucker!

19:46.200 --> 19:47.540
Damn you!

19:47.540 --> 19:50.660
Isn't she getting a bit too hot-headed?

19:51.000 --> 19:52.920
This is bad.

19:52.920 --> 19:54.830
She isn't looking at her surroundings.

20:01.260 --> 20:06.180
Rest

20:01.260 --> 20:06.180
Continue

20:01.260 --> 20:06.180
Keishin

20:01.260 --> 20:06.180
Suzuridani

20:01.260 --> 20:04.010
The first quarter is coming to an end.

20:04.010 --> 20:06.180
Their three-man defence...

20:06.180 --> 20:09.270
If we don't watch out, we'll be crushed by it.

20:09.670 --> 20:12.310
We've got to play our cards before it's too late.

20:16.480 --> 20:20.240
It's a bit early, but I'm going to change Saki to point guard.

20:20.780 --> 20:21.530
Is that okay?

20:21.530 --> 20:22.280
Yes.

20:22.280 --> 20:23.860
I'm fine.

20:23.860 --> 20:25.370
It's up to you, Saki.

20:25.370 --> 20:27.410
Pass the ball to me more.

20:27.410 --> 20:29.580
I'll read the situation and decide.

20:38.460 --> 20:39.920
Saki, pass it over!

20:40.510 --> 20:41.670
Hina!

20:41.670 --> 20:42.700
Oh~!

20:42.700 --> 20:43.880
Airi!

20:46.370 --> 20:47.300
Don't mind!

20:47.300 --> 20:48.850
We'll get the next shot!

20:50.010 --> 20:51.980
Calm yourself down a little.

20:52.680 --> 20:53.480
Yeah...

20:54.140 --> 20:59.150
Saki is really focussed, and good at analysing the situation calmly.

21:04.900 --> 21:05.990
Saki!

21:06.700 --> 21:07.320
Shameless.

21:07.320 --> 21:09.700
And reckless!

21:09.700 --> 21:10.370
Maho!

21:11.830 --> 21:12.790
Shoot!

21:12.790 --> 21:13.330
Now!

21:14.040 --> 21:15.790
All right!

21:16.460 --> 21:17.420
I can also be...

21:18.040 --> 21:19.460
...just like Mo-kan!

21:25.630 --> 21:27.800
Maho-chan, nice shot!

21:27.800 --> 21:29.720
Amazing, Maho!

21:30.680 --> 21:32.810
It's not like it's decided by one goal.

21:32.810 --> 21:34.060
How stupid.

21:34.350 --> 21:36.310
Everyone's movements have become more fluid.

21:36.310 --> 21:37.440
Yeah.

21:37.440 --> 21:42.400
She can judge the opponents' movements
very well and think of a counter on the spot.

21:42.400 --> 21:45.700
That way, Tomoka can concentrate on offence,

21:45.700 --> 21:48.160
and it becomes easier to get through their defence.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.200
With this...

21:52.080 --> 21:53.160
Yeah.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.500
They'll win!

21:57.790 --> 22:00.790
♪Party love Party love Party love (fuufuu)

22:00.790 --> 22:03.340
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.060 --> 22:14.390
Come on! Come on!

22:14.390 --> 22:17.140
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.140 --> 22:19.650
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
But that's a lie!

22:21.230 --> 22:22.320
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.610 --> 22:24.940
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.360 --> 22:28.030
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.030 --> 22:30.740
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.740 --> 22:32.120
Triple A

22:32.120 --> 22:33.990
I don't need any ratings

22:33.990 --> 22:36.000
I want to grow up faster!

22:36.000 --> 22:36.790
Dribble!

22:36.790 --> 22:37.460
Zig-zag

22:37.460 --> 22:38.120
Defence!

22:38.120 --> 22:39.000
Offence (Yep!)

22:39.000 --> 22:41.080
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.840 --> 22:49.130
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.680 --> 22:52.180
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.180 --> 22:54.850
Jump! Jump!

22:55.140 --> 22:57.350
More and more and more

22:58.230 --> 23:03.060
When can I become an adult

23:03.060 --> 23:08.860
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.150 --> 23:13.660
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.660 --> 23:20.870
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.250 --> 23:24.340
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.000 --> 23:28.550
Everyone, let's bring out all our strength now!

23:28.550 --> 23:30.720
All right, let's go all out!

23:30.720 --> 23:33.470
What, like when you were so hot-headed just now?

23:33.470 --> 23:35.260
I'll do my best, too!

23:35.260 --> 23:35.890
Oh~!

23:35.890 --> 23:36.760
Me too!

23:36.760 --> 23:37.520
We'll definitely...

23:37.180 --> 23:40.020
Next

23:37.180 --> 23:40.020
My Dream is Your Dream

23:37.830 --> 23:40.020
We'll definitely win!
